// Range Analysis (`RangeInfo`), Path-Sensitive Dominating Guard & Induction-Variable Bounds
// Proofs, Half-Open Sub-Range Disjointness (`[0..mid)` / `[mid..len)`), and Bounds-Check
// Elimination (`opt_bce`) Engine (T610 / E15.3).
// Implements SPEC-72 §2 (AXS-BCE-001..006, REQ-OPT-001, REQ-OPT-026, REQ-OPT-133..142,
// REQ-OPT-189, REQ-OPT-190, REQ-OPT-311, REQ-OPT-342).
